# Dawn of a New Age: at the beginning of the end step it has one hope counter. In response to the trigger Bot1 destroys it
# with Disenchant. It can no longer have a counter removed, so no card is drawn ("if you do"), and its last known state
# had a hope counter, so "if it has no hope counters" is false: no sacrifice and no life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Dawn of a New Age
Disenchant
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x17

